### 10. CENTRALIZED PERMISSIONS AND RECORD SCOPE

Reuse the existing SCHLAR permission registry. Do not create a competing permission system.

Enforce the existing role and record-scope rules consistently in:

- Navigation visibility.
- Route access.
- Page rendering.
- Action buttons.
- Event handlers.
- Record selectors.
- Data reads.
